 toggle it between <strong>TRUE</strong> or <strong>FALSE</strong>. Chips labelled  “<strong>FALSE</strong>” will not be used.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > NICK'S SHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure you'll meet<strong> Nick,</strong> a clumsy professor who live's in the basement's basement. He's running a side-gig selling extra<strong> Battle Chips</strong> and<strong> Items</strong>. You can return to him at any point to purchase new chips to help you turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ef0da5f893900db6857ea474597336f7.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ef0da5f893900db6857ea474597336f7.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ef0da5f893900db6857ea474597336f7.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Switch between two charismatic professors to solve programming puzzles, explore the depths of the MAD program, and battle rogue errors using a customizable chip-based combat system. Reprogram Terminals, build your deck, and stop the Code Calamity before it takes over the world!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/c74175c3dc2d5dee763b10761c34edfda35bad6e/header.jpg?t=1747921300", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/04abd3c90f3526bdd2291d72bcb4d9bc8e486cce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747921300", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/04abd3c90f3526bdd2291d72bcb4d9bc8e486cce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747921300", "webs